{"comment_text": {"ja34:0.1": "", "ja34:0.2": "", "ja34:0.3": "", "ja34:0.4": "", "ja34:1.1": "When a fish is caught in the net while his wife escapes, he worries more about what she thinks of him than of his imminent fate. ", "ja34:1.2": "", "ja34:1.3": "", "ja34:1.4": "", "ja34:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja34:0.1": "<article id='ja34'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja34:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja34:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja34:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja34:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja34:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja34:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja34:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja34:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja34:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja34:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja34:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja34:0.4": "4. Macchajātaka ", "ja34:1.1": "“Na maṁ sītaṁ na maṁ uṇhaṁ, ", "ja34:1.2": "na maṁ jālasmi bādhanaṁ; ", "ja34:1.3": "Yañca maṁ maññate macchī, ", "ja34:1.4": "aññaṁ so ratiyā gato”ti. ", "ja34:2.1": "Macchajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja34:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 34 ", "ja34:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja34:0.3": "Nests ", "ja34:0.4": "The Fish: a past life story ", "ja34:1.1": "It’s not the cold or heat for me, ", "ja34:1.2": "nor the being caught in the net; ", "ja34:1.3": "it’s that my lady, the fish, thinks of me, ", "ja34:1.4": "“He went for joy to another.” ", "ja34:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja34:0.1": "", "ja34:0.2": "", "ja34:0.3": "", "ja34:0.4": "", "ja34:1.1": "dr27.13, ms22J_74, msdiv34, pts-vp-pli1.211, sya27.12", "ja34:1.2": "", "ja34:1.3": "", "ja34:1.4": "", "ja34:2.1": "ms22J_75"}, "keys_order": ["ja34:0.1", "ja34:0.2", "ja34:0.3", "ja34:0.4", "ja34:1.1", "ja34:1.2", "ja34:1.3", "ja34:1.4", "ja34:2.1"]}